  "body": "## What changed\nA cut list and a cut line replace the `P1` / `P2` start condition of a cut (#1424).\n\n- `AGENTS.md`: the new rules **The cut list** and **The cut line** in \"Commits and Releases\". The priority table says that a priority does not hold a cut.\n- `.claude/skills/release-cut/SKILL.md`: step 1 is the cut list procedure. The \"Known issues\" text names each open `P1` or `P2` that is not on the list.\n- `.claude/skills/merge-ready/SKILL.md`: during a cut, the skill offers only the PRs on the cut list.\n\n## Why\nThe maintainer ordered it on 2026-11-17, during the v0.23.0 cut: \"Do not let ANYTHING else into the cut.. fix it, cut it.. stop faffing around\". He ordered the hold too: \"Add the docs changes to its own branch and hold the PR for after cut\".\n\n## Readings\nDocs only. No code, no test and no gate changed.\n\n## Not exercised\nNo cut ran with these rules. The v0.23.0 cut ran with the old start condition and the maintainer's direct order.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
